  "$comment": "Value clean-up. Each field lists canonical values and the spellings that map to them. Matching ignores case, spacing and punctuation, and a trailing '?' is stripped and recorded as 'uncertain'. Values that match nothing are kept as written and reported as a warning. A pattern with \"twoWay\": true (a request/response call) gets its own line with arrows at both ends, and dots that travel both ways.",
